{
  "info": {
    "name": "Q02 · REST frente a SOAP",
    "description": "Colección de Postman para el punto 2 del examen.\n\nLa misma operación de negocio expuesta en REST y en SOAP, con su OpenAPI y su WSDL.\n\nEl context-path de la aplicación es /api, así que todas las URLs cuelgan de él.",
    "_postman_id": "c3a7f1e4-5b62-4d18-9a03-q2b4c5d6e7f8",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080/api",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 · Suite de verificación (10 comprobaciones)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/q2/verify",
        "description": "Comprueba los dos contratos, los dos stubs y que REST y SOAP devuelven lo mismo."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const informe = pm.response.json();",
              "console.log(`Comprobaciones: ${informe.total} | superadas: ${informe.passed} | fallidas: ${informe.failed}`);",
              "pm.test('todas las comprobaciones se superan', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(informe.failed).to.eql(0);",
              "    pm.expect(informe.passed).to.eql(informe.total);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01 · REST · calcular presupuesto",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/q2/rest/quotes",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"sku\": \"SKU-1\",\n  \"quantity\": 3,\n  \"customerId\": \"VIP-9\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "La operación en REST. Devuelve unitPrice 19.99 y total 53.97 (19.99 x 3 con 10 % de descuento VIP)."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('responde 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
              "pm.test('el total es 53.97', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().total).to.eql(53.97);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 · SOAP · calcular presupuesto",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "text/xml; charset=utf-8"
          },
          {
            "key": "SOAPAction",
            "value": "http://example.com/quote/quote"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/q2/soap/quote-service",
        "description": "La MISMA operación en SOAP. El sobre va en el cuerpo y el Content-Type es text/xml.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<soapenv:Envelope xmlns:soapenv=\"http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/\">\n  <soapenv:Body>\n    <ns2:quote xmlns:ns2=\"http://example.com/quote\">\n      <ns2:sku>SKU-1</ns2:sku>\n      <ns2:quantity>3</ns2:quantity>\n      <ns2:customerId>VIP-9</ns2:customerId>\n    </ns2:quote>\n  </soapenv:Body>\n</soapenv:Envelope>",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "xml"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('responde 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
              "pm.test('el total es 53.97', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.contain('<ns2:total>53.97</ns2:total>');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 · Contrato REST (OpenAPI 3.1)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/q2/openapi.yaml",
        "description": "El contrato del servicio REST, el equivalente del WSDL."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "04 · Contrato SOAP (WSDL 1.1)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/q2/soap/quote-service.wsdl",
        "description": "El contrato del servicio SOAP. Es lo que leería un wsimport para generar el stub."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "05 · REST · producto desconocido",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/q2/rest/quotes",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"sku\": \"NOPE\",\n  \"quantity\": 3,\n  \"customerId\": \"C-1\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "El error de negocio en REST: 400 con el mensaje. La misma causa, otro dialecto."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('responde 400', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(400); });",
              "pm.test('explica el motivo', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().message).to.contain('unknown sku');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "06 · SOAP · producto desconocido",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "text/xml; charset=utf-8"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/q2/soap/quote-service",
        "description": "El mismo error en SOAP: un SOAP Fault con el mismo mensaje. Ojo: un fault se devuelve con HTTP 500, que es lo que dicta la convención SOAP.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<soapenv:Envelope xmlns:soapenv=\"http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/\">\n  <soapenv:Body>\n    <ns2:quote xmlns:ns2=\"http://example.com/quote\">\n      <ns2:sku>NOPE</ns2:sku>\n      <ns2:quantity>3</ns2:quantity>\n      <ns2:customerId>C-1</ns2:customerId>\n    </ns2:quote>\n  </soapenv:Body>\n</soapenv:Envelope>",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "xml"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('el sobre trae un SOAP Fault', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.contain('SOAP-ENV:Fault');",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.contain('unknown sku');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
